OL,3,AColombian police storm supermarket to
OL,4,Afree 20 held hostage for 17 hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FColombian security forces have freed
OL,7,Faround 20 shoppers and employees who
OL,8,Fhad been held hostage for about 17
OL,9,Fhours at a supermarket in the city of
OL,10,FCartagena.
OL,12,FGunmen had stormed into the building at
OL,13,F08:00 local time (13:00 GMT) on Tuesday
OL,14,Fafter what Colombian President Abelardo
OL,15,Fde la Espriella said was a failed
OL,16,Fattempt at robbing an armoured car
OL,17,Fcarrying money.
OL,19,FThey held those inside at gunpoint
OL,20,Fwhile trying to negotiate their
OL,21,Fgetaway.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
